,"Netlify hosts the website and API and receives a copy of submitted orders and inquiries through Netlify Forms for owner notifications. Neon stores the records shown in the administrator Inbox, and Cloudinary stores product images. The owner may receive these submission details by email through Netlify notifications. The owner must confirm retention and access arrangements for these copies, and any additional parties involved in delivery."],["Browser storage and access","Your browser stores product IDs and quantities for your cart and a short submission throttle. Administrator access uses a secure session cookie. Access to order and inquiry records is restricted to authenticated administrators."],["Retention and requests","Owner to confirm: how long orders, bookings, quotations, messages and security records are retained, and how deletion or correction requests are handled. Contact Two Tech using the details below to ask about your information."],["Changes to this notice","The owner should review and update this notice when the website, providers or data-handling practices change."]]},"terms":{"title":"Orders & Returns","intro":"Owner review required: this draft explains the current ordering process. The owner must complete the policy items marked below; they are not promises about unconfirmed services or return rights.","sections":[["Order requests and prices","Submitting checkout creates an order received reference. It does not mean the order is paid or confirmed for fulfilment. The server checks product availability, stock, current prices and the configured delivery fee when the order is submitted. Two Tech will contact you regarding the next steps."],["Payment methods","Payment is Cash on Pickup/Delivery or manual Bank/GCash transfer. No card payment is collected or processed on this website. For a transfer, follow the current payment instructions shown at checkout. The administrator marks payment only after verifying it."],["Pickup, delivery and reservations",